EXTERNAL place_characters(left_character_name, right_character_name)
EXTERNAL change_emotion(emotion, ID)
EXTERNAL remove_character(ID)


{place_characters("", "Butler")}
{change_emotion("Happy", 1)}

Good evening everyone! Master Richard has requested everyone make their way up to their bedrooms to retire for the evening. The celebrations shall continue tomorrow. #speaker:Butler

{remove_character(0)}

The guests all quickly make their way out of the dining hall and up the large set of stairs in the main entrance way. You follow behind, trying to figure out the layout of the place as you do. 

-> END